---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: "Ọ̀NÀ — Yoruba words, proverbs, Ifá/Odù, and culture, verified and unverified content clearly marked."
---
<section class="hero animate-in">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Ọ̀NÀ · The Path</p>
  <h1>Ọ̀rọ̀, Òwe àti Àṣà Yorùbá</h1>
  <p class="lede">Ọ̀NÀ is a living archive of Yoruba words, proverbs, Ifá/Odù, and culture — {{ entries.length }} entries, fieldwork-verified and web-researched content marked honestly, side by side. Explore below, test what you know, or dig into the full archive.</p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/entries/' | url }}">Wo Gbogbo Àkọsílẹ̀ — Browse Entries</a>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ '/quiz/' | url }}">Bẹ̀rẹ̀ Quiz — Test Yourself</a>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Nípa wa — About</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band band-alt animate-in d1">
{% set sample = entries | where("domain", "njeomo") | limit(1) %}
<section class="game-cta">
  <div class="game-cta-inner">
    <div class="game-cta-text">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Ńjẹ́ o mọ̀? — Did You Know?</span>
      <h2>Ṣe o mọ Yorùbá dáadáa? — Test your knowledge</h2>
      <p>{{ entries | where("domain", "njeomo") | length }} quiz questions pulled straight from fieldwork records — same set playable here or on the Telegram bot. Got a question of your own, or something to correct? Send it our way, here or on Telegram.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/quiz/' | url }}">Ṣeré Quiz — Play the Quiz</a>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ '/search/' | url }}">Beere Ìbéèrè — Ask via Search</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://t.me/OnaYorubaBot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@OnaYorubaBot</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if sample.length %}
    <div class="sample-question">
      <p class="sample-label">Àpẹẹrẹ ìbéèrè — Sample question</p>
      <p class="sample-q">{{ sample[0].question_english or sample[0].english }}</p>
      <a class="btn small" href="{{ '/quiz/' | url }}">Fi ìdáhùn hàn →</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
</div>

<section class="animate-in d2 pillar-pointer">
  <span class="section-eyebrow">Explore by pillar</span>
  <h2>Àwọn Ọ̀wọ́n Márùn-ún — Five Pillars</h2>
  <p>Language, natural science, ethics &amp; Ifá, identity &amp; genealogy, philosophy &amp; cosmology. Open the menu to enter any of them.</p>
  <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-open-menu>Open the menu ☰</button>
</section>
